{"accountName": "GeekPwn", "author": "GeekPwn", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "🤖️ 2022-11-02 21:00 上海", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2022 G-TOP 年度极客榜，揭晓！", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 1, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4209aibfvNUadgG6Z8mgMBgykXGTBuI5fWtUREWoiaxOyf6hBaeALJTibQ/0?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "当共享汽车被“免费”解锁，智能汽车被远程控制，在线视频被窃听，我们的智能生活还安全吗？ 如果将未发生的安全隐患提前演练，在危险到来前及时修复漏洞，智能生活是否会更美好？ 今年的 GeekPwn 安全极客大赛也许能带我们找到答案。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 2, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4rh6F1eUxTiaKfsx3nEUH9rcz8mzz5rpiaycEKaor2jFFeFITZra8VuXw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "在GeekPwn的舞台上，不论年龄、性别、职业、学历，只要热爱和擅长发现网络世界的安全隐患，发现产业智能与消费智能潜在的安全问题，都能在赛场展示实力，为极客信仰而战。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 3, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ44Y2z1GMAe96Zh3H07VBSxiaZTI27s7HRHOx2dEO9PZtHkk5C4csNDSw/640?wx_fmt=png", "type": "img"}, {"text": "经过4天的激烈比拼，2022 G-TOP年度极客榜单最终出炉。光年虚拟化小分队挑战的《“越狱”——逃出虚拟机》项目，通过利用相关缺陷实现虚拟机逃逸，完成网安领域公认的高技术难度挑战，以6.04分荣登G-TOP年度极客榜冠军。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": 4, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4FMS3EQFtqfGic1eK5CxVRpeoekunFcxcib7icCdt2w3IO7tNvJCHkibtNQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 5, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4sNzEn8Afo712yJwM45mg8OAtpeNxuGUBbrsNJXqEua08A1bI7L1uvg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 6, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4SGpXQ3icOA1JHjs3iaboXNib4aOye1dOA30hxI9hviauZakp5ibXf8KyGzw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 7, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibZuHRCMKQxJTdXwXMYb3LsxckDsk8QZ4zYBrAce2OZ3SWcY5lxhNB90esgicGkibDgCFYHo8c74xgA5icywL9Kib3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg", "type": "img"}, {"_imgCount": 8, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbi